## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation Strategy |
|------|-------------|--------|-------------------|
| Malicious or altered transaction presented to maker | Medium | High | Validate and simulate the complete transaction before signing; restrict approved caller programs |
| Settlement math or rounding error | Low | High | Checked integer math, unit and integration tests, Kani proofs, and security review |
| Stale or replayed RFQ | Medium | Medium | Short on-chain expiry, active maker signature, and off-chain RFQ ID controls |
| Unsupported token behavior | Medium | High | Token compatibility checks and rejection of non-zero Token-2022 transfer fees |
| Signing key compromise | Low | High | Secure key custody, authorization limits, monitoring, rotation, and emergency revocation |
| Integration mismatch between aggregator and RFQ program | Medium | High | Versioned instruction schema, CPI integration tests, and staged deployment |

